      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1913-05-17_WidnesExaminer_art0065" n="art0065">
        <head>RICHARD JEFFREYS,</head>
        <p>RICHARD JEFFREYS,</p>
        <p>Frame Maker, Print Seller, Carver and Gilder. and Picture Frames Re-gilded. BOLD STREET, LIVERPOOL.</p>
