        <p>constituency to advocate Tariff Reform. I am a Tariff Reformer, but I am not a fool." We take him to mean not that to be a Tariff "Reformer" is to be a fool, but that it would be</p>
        <p>foolish to advocate Tariff "Reform" in such a constituency as Altrincham. It is a hopeless pass to which a great party in the State has been reduced, but as long as the incubus survives there will be no chance of escape.</p>
