        <p>DON'T LOOK OLD—Keep the ravages of time at bay by darkening the grey streaks with LOCKYER'S SULPHUR HAIR RE STORER,which deepens to a naturaleolourin afew days.Lockyer's maintains a youthful appearance. Large bots everywhere. Post free 1/6. Bedford Laboratory, Landon,S.E</p>
        <p>has not been handled so well as previously and they allege that pilfering has increased owing to the extra facilities given hy the holding up of goods for long periods at various points.</p>
        <p>Naturally the extra charges and stricter regulations of the Companies have made the traders economise in the use of the railway facilities and the result is that fewer of the men in whose behalf the move was made are now neided. Workingmen are affected in other ways; and we understand that at the present time a body of them are petitioning against the raising of the prices of week-end tickets —used by men working in Liverpool—to 2s. Gd.</p>
        <p>_ Lastly, the public appear destined to feel the effect of the additional charges.</p>
        <p>One gentleman in an influential position told our representative, yesterday, that the companies might have been satisfied with taking their statutory rights ithout as a preliminary inflicting upon trade the many extra charges and inconveniences that they have gradually applied.</p>
