        <p>Maids-of Honour:— Gracie Rixun, Violet Gillings, Margaret Wrigley, Mona Jones, Morrie Wbitelegg, Bessie Brazendale, Grace Tim perky, Vera Perrin. Flower Girls—Nellie Wright, Sarah Thomason, Dora Davies, eissie Wright.</p>
        <p>Fisher Girls—N.elly Leigh, Florence Taylor, Bsrtha Leigh, Mary Faby. Quaker Girls—Lora Dixon, Maud Gilbert. Cow Girls—Maggie Driver, Mary Saw. SWISS Peasants—Cissy Tonge, Eliza Shaw. Carmen—Louisa Jennings. Folly—Ethel Shaw. Mary Queen of Scots—Elsie Melrose. Sbepherdess—Mary Daniels. Joan of Arc—Marion Evans. Scotch Lassie—Cissue Seed.</p>
        <p>Red Hiding flood—Elizabeth .Astbury. Britannia—Cdrcie Wright. Witch—lvy Sbaw. Pierette—Hllda Brooks. Eastern Princess—Mabel Hewitt. Grace DArling—Edith Ciotti!).</p>
