        <p>Cleopatra—Laura Seymour. 80-Peep—Emmie Shuker Cro.vn Bearer—Reggie Blount. Sceptre Bearer—Jack Heaven. Train Bearers—Wilfred Heaven and Sidney Johnson. Standard Bearers—Norman White and Joe Morris. Heralds—Daniel Percival and Archie Chapman. Courtiers—R(4)M Bell and Jack Robiusou. Beefeaters—He ry Thompron, Herbert Kinsey, Frank Ravenscroft, Albert Brazendale. Robinson Crusoe—C. Dar byshire. Man Friday—Horace Thompson. Princes of the Tower—Leslie Green and Jack Smith. Dick Whittington—Jack Shaw. His Cat—James Cheetham. Judge—John Dewer. John Bull—Alfred Massey. Jester—Percy Moss. RAneo—John Guest. Welsh 11y—Harry Owen. Imps—Peter Whitelegg and Arthur Leigh. Hindoo—John Soanes. Pieriott—James Mairs. Crusader—Rupert Oddie. Turk—Fred Jackson. Grace Darling's Father—C. Jones. Gondolier—H. Readitt. Magician—Wm. Mather. Coster—E. Booth. Sailors—W'. Mather and Harry Leigh. Soldiers—Sidney Fogg and W. Stokes. King of Hearts—Walter Kinsey. King of Diamonds—W. Wibberley. King of Clubs—s Tom Knowles. King of Spades—Wm. Daniels. Oliver Cromwell—Rd. Atherton. Yankee—Ralph Bit. Brigand—Tom Reed. Lord Nelson—Frank Wright. Irishman—Herbert Leigh. Scotchman—Thos. Taylor. Red Indian—Harold Atherton. Clowns—Sidney Leigh and Arthur Goffin. Hamlet—Tom Driver. Cowboys—Cecil Creasey and Sydney Howcroft. King Charles—Willie Gough. Napoleon—John Worrall. Lord Roberts—Harry Cadman. Duke of Wellington—Vincent Hinton. Hungarian Officer.—Gilbert Stott. Old English Officer—James Skelhorn. Indian Rajah—George Davies. Robin Hood—Alfred Leigh. Foresters—Sidney Jackson and Harry Brookes. Boy Blue—Arthur Leigh. Pieriott—W. Skelhorn.</p>
        <p>Cowboy—Tom Shaw. Maypole Dancers—Annie Artingstall, Edith Nield, Maggie Armstrong, Gertie Ogden,Lillie Morton, LiLzie Bate, Esther Warham, Phyllis Ardern, Cissie 'rouge, Hilda Ratcliff, Connie Lewis, Ruth Woodhead, Norah Joynson, Hilda Wilson. Italian Dancers—David Jones, Mabel Owen, George Morton, Edna Jones, Willie Davies, Elsie Bell, Harold Lord, Norah Booth, George Whitelegge Nlattie Skid- more, Willie Lord, Lizcie Lewis, Willie Whitelegge, Gertie Smith, Horace Artingstall, Hilda Robinson.</p>
        <p>Country Dancers—Jessie Davies, Elizabeth on • cannon, May Artingstall, Edie Leather, Ballie Ogden, Ida Lord, May Marland, Gladys Downwood. Irish Jig—Lettie Ogden, Hilda Drinkwatnr, Bessie Lord, Annie Lewis, Agnes Robinson, Frances Robinson, Annie Jones, Amy Daniels. Lantern Dancers.—Elinor Bell, Rhoda Woodhead, Esther Soanes, May Goffin, Huth Wilson, Annie Leigh, Josephine Brown, Bertha Leigh, Eva Tango, Maggie Lewis.</p>
