        <p>How This Woman was Restored to Health by Lydia</p>
        <p>E. Pinkham's Vegetable Compound.</p>
        <p>"For seven year:</p>
        <p>I suffered everything. ,ed for four or five</p>
        <p>ays at a time, and o weak I could tardly walk. I had ramps, backache and headache, an d .as so nervous and Tak that I dreaded ) see anyone or ave anyone move in the room. The doc- ors gave me medicine .o ease me at those</p>
