        <p>_ have a surgical operation. I would not listen to that, and when a friend of my husband's told him about Lydia E. Pinkham's Vegetable Compound and what it had done for his wife, I was willing to take it. Now I look the picture of health and feel like it, too. I can do all my own housework, work in the garden and entertain and enjoy company, and can walk as far in a day as most women. I wish I could speak to every suffer;ng woman and girl, and tell them. what Lydia E. Pinkham's Vegetable Compound has done for me." (Name and address on request).</p>
        <p>Proof is abundant and convincing, showing that after all other means have failed Lydia E. Pinkham's Vegetable Compound helps women who are troubled with displacements, in tlammation, ulcera- tion, tumours, bacLi elle, that bearing-down feeling, indigestion, and nervous prostra- tion. Why don't you try it? Write to-day tor a tree private book to women only) to the Lady Manager, the Lydia. E. Pinkham Medicine Co., 42a Hampstead Road, London, N.W. For 2s. 9d. she will send you a bottle of the Lydia E. Pinkham Vegetable Compound, or for 43. 6d. a much larircr bottle. Any chemist will supply it at these prices.</p>
