      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1913-05-17_WidnesExaminer_art0147" n="art0147">
        <head>HAIR DESTROYER</head>
        <p>HAIR DESTROYER</p>
        <p>James' Depilatory</p>
        <p>Instantly removes Superfluous Hairs from the face, Neck, or Arms, without injury to the skin. Of most chemists; or, free from observation, post free on receipt of Postal Order for Is. 3d., 2s. 9d., or 51.—Mrs. N. JAmma, 268, Caledonian Road, London, N.</p>
