      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1913-05-17_WidnesExaminer_art0166" n="art0166">
        <head>WARRINGTON LIBERAL ASSOCIATION.</head>
        <p>WARRINGTON LIBERAL ASSOCIATION.</p>
        <p>Peter Peacock Challenge Cup.</p>
        <p>The only two matches in this competition played on ' Saturday were Latchford E who beat Whitecross C by 26 points, and St. John's A winning over Howley D by 66 points. Owing to the remaining matches for Saturday last having to be postponed through had weather, we have been asked to publish the following re-arranged list : Matches for to-day are as published in our issue of Saturday last. Matches for Saturday May 24th are the matches postponed from Saturday May 3rd. Matches for May 31st are as follows :- 2.0 Bewsey Dv. Orford D. 2.45 Whitecross D v. Whitecross G. 3.30 Whitecross N v. Fairfield G. 4.15 Whitecross K v. Bewsey A. 5.0 Howley Av. Orford A. 5.45 St. John's E V. St. John's B. 6.30 St. John's C v. Howley E. 7.15 Town Hall B V. St. Austin's F. Will captains of teams kindly note the altered times, and inform the players.</p>
      </div>
