        <p>242 163 Bull's Head won by 79. HEATON PARK CONSERVATIVES V. NEWTON-LE- WILLOWS.-At the Bird in Hand, Fliaton, on Saturday. Scores :—Newton, 233 ; Heaton Park, 185. PARK (BIRKDALE) v. C.W.S. (IRLAM).—At Warring- ton Cemetery Hotel on Saturday. Scores :—C.W.S., 216; Park, 210. STANLEY ARMS (LIVERPOOL) V. CITORLTON BOWLING GREEN.-At Newton-le-Willows on Saturday. Scores : Stanley Arms, 206 ; Chorlton 8.G., 219. WHITEC ROSS BECREATIoN V. WESTINGHOUSE.— Played on the green of the Wigan Limited Club on Saturday. Scores : WHITECROSS. WESTINGHOUSE. A. Cleave 2l H. Attley lO A. Thornley . W. Jones J. Horton 2l S Sackville 2O J. Appleton 2l J. Guest T. Ellison lO W. Leverett 2l J. Slavin P. Gleave 2l F. Royle A. Warbui ton . H. Broadhurst 2l J. Wilson l4 W. Shaw A. Siddall</p>
        <p>233 W'hitecroas won by 36.</p>
        <p>WARRINGTON JUNIOR CONSERVATIVES V. MAN AND SCYTHE (BOLTON).—Played on the green of the Leigh Limited Club on Saturday. Scores:— CONSERVATIVES. MAN AND SCYTHE. J Gleave R Holbrook 2l T Gaskell l2 H Monks 2l J Woletenholme l9 J Dagnall 2l A Ivill H Bennett W Skelhorne T Cooper 8 %V Morton 2l H Holbrook J Bate C Gatlqy E Blackledge lB W Mayah H Taylor 2l 3 Grundy</p>
